  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Provide 171 Artisans Warm Meals for 1 Month</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Imani Collective is a socio-economic empowerment program on a mission to alleviate poverty in Kenya. We provide holistic support to support our artisan&apos;s journey to economic freedom. During the LBL campaign, we are working to fully fund one month of nutritious meals for 137 employees and their children. We currently serve 3,100 free meals a month, ensuring our employees have the nutrition they need to work hard and the certainty that their children will grow up strong.</narrative>
  </description>
